<reference id="REUSE_R_list-of-local-it-support-teams" audience="staff students">
    <title>List of Local IT Support Teams</title>
    <shortdesc>Most colleges and administrative units have specialized IT support teams.</shortdesc>
    <prolog>
        <author>Alice White</author>
        <source href="https://oit.ncsu.edu/about/local-it-support/" scope="external"/>
        <critdates><created date="2026-11-21"/></critdates>
    </prolog>

    <refbody>
        <section>
            Although the NC State Help Desk is always available for general problems, your local IT support team is the best place to go for support. These teams are most knowledgeable of the IT processes and needs of each college and unit.
        <note conref="conrefs.dita#reusable-conref-elements/help-desk-contact-info"/>
        </section>
